VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'server. You can connect them from a local device. You can connect agents that aren\'t connected to you that are running on any machine. Doesn\'t matter. But, the thing is like the agent and Buzz itself are different, so don\'t think that Buzz is like providing the AI'

